lass=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754430/extras/917975c048c08cdf0c31620965b6da81.avif?t=1778821191\" width=580 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Breed your favourite frogs together to get new frogs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754430/extras/732bee7fbf9f64512bf7fec0a8363b3d.poster.avif?t=1778821191\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754430/extras/732bee7fbf9f64512bf7fec0a8363b3d.webm?t=1778821191\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754430/extras/732bee7fbf9f64512bf7fec0a8363b3d.mp4?t=1778821191\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A big thank you for supporting my first Steam title! As a solo developer I truly appreciate everyone who has supported the game. Please consider Wishlisting this game if you are even just a little bit interested!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754430/extras/ad6605be65b4740f7bfb7e0c64ca23be.avif?t=1778821191\" width=800 height=80 /></span></p>",
